      <h2>About Stone Town Food Market</h2>
      <div>Darajani Market is Stone Town's bustling central marketplace where the rhythm of daily Zanzibari life unfolds. Early morning brings fishing boats unloading fresh catch — tuna, kingfish, octopus, lobster — while vendors display pyramids of tropical fruits (mangoes, jackfruit, passion fruit, rambutan), aromatic spices, fresh vegetables, and household goods. The sensory immersion — colors, aromas, Swahili bargaining, calls to prayer — offers an authentic glimpse into local life. Best visited early morning (7-9 AM) before tourist crowds.</div>
